From 3459114fbcbbbb7e26a9ac8fc8eb89abd05255a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:13:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tor: update to 0.4.9.13

The files changed since 0.4.9.12, from the signature-verified release
tarball: ten TROVE fixes rated High upstream (TLS handshake-failure
use-after-free, reverse-DNS double free, stream-isolation bypass and
others), plus refreshed geoip and fallback directories. configure and
orconfig.h.in~ regenerated by the build's autoreconf. Tor is off by
default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
